# Shared custom agents, one owner/repo[@ref] per line. Pin each entry to a
# tag or a commit. Entries resolve against github.com.
# A subagent for the whole company can live in agents/ instead, with no entry
# here. An agent that belongs to one component needs no entry either: its
# .agents/subagents/ directory travels with that repository.
# Example:
# acme/review-agents@1a2b3c4
